<title>USA: Modine says FY97 outlook unchanged.</title>
<headline>Modine says FY97 outlook unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>RACINE, Wis. 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Modine Manufacturing Co said its earlier outlook of about a four-percent increase in earnings for the fiscal year ending in March remains unchanged despite lower-than-projected sales growth.</p>
<p>&quot;The translation effect of a stronger dollar has impacted foreign-currency-denominated sales. The company also has experienced lower-than-anticipated revenues from some domestic markets,&quot; the company said.</p>
<p>&quot;Fiscal 1997 sales are likely to total a little over $1 billion,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
